/**
    ExSoundEditorSounds

    Author: Valdemar
    Version: 1.0

    Generation date: 28.7.2026
    - Remember to update if changing WE Sound Editor sound variables...

    Description: Generated Sound Editor registry from temp/war3map.w3s. Registers each gg_snd_* variable with ExSound using the filepath exported from war3map.w3s.

    Credits:
    - WC3MapTranslator war3map.w3s format

    How to install:
    Import after ExSound. This library references the generated gg_snd_* globals from the map sound editor.

    API:
    call ExSoundEditorSounds_RegisterAll()
    set path = ExSoundEditorSounds_GetPath("Stormstrike")

**/
library ExSoundEditorSounds initializer Init requires ExSound

globals
    private boolean ESES_Registered = false
endglobals

public function GetPath takes string soundLabel returns string
    return ExSound_GetEditorSoundPath(soundLabel)
endfunction

public function RegisterAll takes nothing returns nothing
    if ESES_Registered then
        return
    endif
    set ESES_Registered = true

